    "token": {
      "A": "browser localStorage; sent on every call; the relay holds it for one request (or the boot thread), keeps a sha256 digest (relay.py digest/Boot.token_digest). Jupyter token = HMAC(secret, session) (relay.py kernel_token): derived, never stored.",
